<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudanese armed forces carried out a drone strike on Abyei’s Amiet market, killing dozens and injuring many, and a separate drone strike hit a market in the disputed Abyei border region, also causing high casualties. In Ruweng fresh attacks left nine dead and six wounded, while bodies arrived from the Khor Kaltan killings in Northern Bahr el Ghazal. Communal clashes continued, including 14 deaths between Warrap and Lakes communities and the arrest of a traditional chief over a Juba youth killing. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPbG1vU0U0WS1EdmRtWE1Jd3ZfRC1kT3lwSW11NGQzelFIUWI2NURkT2VKaGtsZnEyWE94N1hiR3RfQThQbDhxb3hna19HRlhGUkVpOU5GRi1RZDBwekx1X2pnRnVRa2VCSEU3Q1ZWZUdudXBlUEU5ZUlDdW5RNENmY3ZKZ0xUUlZfX1J5c1EydXpjSzktdjgzZWl1dFMwaERqQ0d3bHhvbEwtNnZRWVZiQW4xTGMxQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNVVRSM3dyWk9CNTlUcUJIemVkUGlYTGt4MUE2eTJCaDBXX2I4NGY2WUVsbDIySWdpSWcycVNXSXVVUzdEMnYyb2kzT3daTVRfdHh5S2tCbnpQVGJsUHVlRXh0MHdhMkVwcXE1M1AtSGFvZWtkTkNTcGRhTEhlcEhORW5PeC0zOGRCSVNJTEI2UWJsWXRrblBUbUE0Y2dYYjNfTl9EcE9iMjlLajFQOXRPOXdwZ2doTWgt0gG-AUFVX3lxTE9NVHFQd3NYVTBVWEVBUlpNVGpKODRleFF5cUxHRl9qYkNKWFlqMV9PNXNDTFFobnR6RWx1ZmpKVXdnQTJlZFVIaHNMWUZuRE1LR1lab2tCZWtsXzJldEZmT0pyQVozdHR0SU8tYi1YTk8xN0FaTnozd0lETVNvNWpKbFdxRFZJajM0d2xST3RjZmc1anc0M1l5TFpSMENWYUtmSldUal9uektKZFh6QjdHM0FKQVNDRTRpdHZTMEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQZHdPdHJvbUlsMVFnY29MWXpHZHZJQjN6dXRoVW5vVmp0Qng5ZjItd25wZ014Y29EMGFOWDY1b1JWdV9lRTcyS21leHVzNUQ3aTRDMU5wLTlqUXhoYXRuTkNjZUVVTjF1dFYyMzNLM0tieU9VNWhVUzJILTdWT3MzQ3VUc3Y5cGkxVjhpN3h